132:Remediation: Security and Architect complete the authored baseline artifacts, normalize required metadata, and rerun the strict audit. Owner: Security + Architect; proposed target 2026-11-10 / before production security qualification. Tracking: SEC-02. Proposed disposition is a bounded local feature carryover because these existing global documents are outside approved F0006 implementation scope; no passing audit or approval is fabricated.
